Great. Now probe verifyText/lintFile/findFiles/createConfigLoader/createLinter/createDefaultConfigs, plus concurrency and worker.

For verifyText we need a FlatConfigArray. We can construct ESLint, access private? Not accessible. We can build FlatConfigArray ourselves:

const { FlatConfigArray } = require("/testbed/lib/config/flat-config-array");
const configs = new FlatConfigArray([{files:["**/*.js"], rules:{semi:["error","always"]}}], { basePath: dir });
await configs.normalize();
const linter = new Linter({configType:"flat", cwd: dir});
